  "description": "Please Note: USB Cable Sold Separately The Elf Bar Dual 10K Prefilled Pod Kit reinvents the prefilled pod experience by combining two unique flavours in one easy-to-use, reusable, device. Ideal for vapers who prioritise variety, the Dual 10K allows you to toggle seamlessly between flavours, giving you the freedom to switch up your vape with a simple flick of the switch. The 850mAh built-in battery delivers reliable power throughout the day, while USB Type-C charging makes recharging fast and efficient. Each kit includes two prefilled 2ml pods and two 5ml refill containers, so you can refill on the go without needing separate e-liquid bottles. The transparent design of the refill containers allows you to check your e-liquid levels at a glance. With a 3-level battery indicator, you can also track battery life with ease, ensuring that your device is ready whenever you need it. Elf Bar has created 20 exciting flavour editions, each featuring two flavours paired to perfection for a uniquely complementary sensory split screen experience. From classic fruit combinations to uniquely exotic blends, and all carrying that uniquely Elf Bar combination of authenticity and rich intensity, there’s a flavour for every taste. The Dual 10K is designed to deliver dense MTL (mouth-to-lung) vapour and immaculate flavour with every puff, making it an excellent choice for vapers who value convenience without sacrificing satisfaction. Please note: We recommend allowing the activated pod to sit for approx. 5 minutes to avoid any dry or burnt hits. Flavours Available: Choose from 20 flavour editions, each offering two distinct Elf Bar flavours: Blue Edition: Acai Berry Blueberry and Acai Berry Lemonade Blueberry Edition: Blueberry and Blueberry Sour Raspberry Cherry Edition: Cherry and Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Ice Drinks Edition: Blue Raspberry Lime and Elfturbo Exotic Edition: Glazed Fruit Medley and Green Lokum Fizzy Edition: Pink Lemonade and Cherry Cola Fruity Edition: Kiwi Passionfruit Guava and Apple Pear Grape Edition: Green Grape and Black Grape Green Edition: Kiwi Passionfruit Guava and Strawberry Banana Dragonfruit Lemon Edition: Lemon Lime and Sour Pineapple Lemonade Pineapple Edition: Pineapple Ice and Pineapple Passionfruit Purple Edition: Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Ice and Blueberry Raspberry Lemonade Raspberry Edition: Cherry Raspberry Lime and Raspberry Mojito Shisha Edition: Fruits 66 and Grape Mint Sour Edition: Sour Blackcurrant and Sour Pineapple Lemonade Special Edition: Cherry and Watermelon Strawberry Edition: Strawberry Ice and Strawberry Kiwi Summer Edition: Mango and Banana Ice Tobacco Edition: Peppermint Tobacco and Snoow Tobacco Watermelon Edition: Watermelon and Watermelon Strawberry Simply select your preferred flavour edition and enjoy a uniquely tailored vaping experience with each pod. The Elf Bar Dual 10K is perfect for vapers who love experimenting with flavours or want the convenience of switching between favourites at any time of the day. Shop Elf Bar 10k Refill Pods",
